longdesc package intended to solve the issues faced by those wishing to
longdesc create multiligual bibliographies. It is intended to be
longdesc backwards-compatible with the standard BibLaTeX package and
longdesc includes significantly enhanced optional functionality: Fields
longdesc in data files can have different form/language alternates in
