name graphicscache
category Package
revision 60150
shortdesc Cache includegraphics calls
relocated 1
longdesc This LaTeX package provides caching of \includegraphics calls,
longdesc with several useful effects: Recompilations are much faster
longdesc (10x speedup observed). Images can be postprocessed with
longdesc ghostscript before inclusion, thus: Automatic downscaling to
longdesc specified DPI Automatic JPEG compression with configurable
longdesc quality Much smaller files (e.g. 10MB instead of 150MB)! Note:
longdesc Due to the one-by-one invocation of pdflatex and ghostscript
longdesc for each graphics element, the first compilation is typically
