longdesc interface to set up and access centralized course data that can
longdesc be reused in all course documents. Furthermore, the package is
longdesc able to calculate the session dates of a whole semester and
longdesc generate course programs, if the course is held weekly and the
longdesc date of the first lecture is specified. Moreover, the package
