shortdesc Miscellaneous helper packages
relocated 1
longdesc This package defines macros which are useful for many
longdesc documents. It is a large collection of simple 'little helpers'
longdesc which do not really warrant a separate package on their own.
longdesc Included are, among other things, definitions of common units
longdesc with preceeding thinspaces, framed boxes where both width and
longdesc height can be specified, starting new odd or even pages, draft
longdesc markers, notes, conditional includes, including EPS files, and
longdesc versions of enumerate and itemize which allow the horizontal
longdesc and vertical spacing to be changed.
