shortdesc Libertine add-on to support Greek and Cyrillic
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides LaTeX support files to access the Greek
longdesc and Cyrillic glyphs in LinuxLibertine. It functions as an
longdesc add-on to the libertine package, using filenames and macro
longdesc names that are compatible with that package. Supported
longdesc encodings: LGR, T2A, T2B, T2C, OT2.
