longdesc the user's document and generate HTML tags. External utility
longdesc programs are only used for the final conversion of text and
longdesc images. Math may be represented by SVG files or MathJax.
longdesc Hundreds of LaTeX packages are supported, and their load order
longdesc is automatically verified. Documents may be produced by LaTeX,
longdesc LuaLaTeX, XeLaTeX, and by several CJK engines, classes, and
