longdesc the Karl Berry fontname scheme and defines four families. Two
longdesc of these primarily provide access to the "standard" or default
longdesc characters while the "alternate" families support alternate
longdesc characters, additional ligatures and the long s. The included
longdesc package files provide access to these features in LaTeX as
