longdesc hexadecimal and binary bases), xintgcd (provides gcd() and
longdesc lcm() functions to xintexpr), xintseries (evaluates numerically
longdesc partial sums of series and power series with fractional
longdesc coefficients), and xintcfrac (dedicated to the computation and
longdesc display of continued fractions). All computations are
