name zhmetrics
category Package
revision 22207
shortdesc TFM subfont files for using Chinese fonts in 8-bit TeX
relocated 1
longdesc These are metrics to use existing Chinese TrueType fonts in
longdesc workflows that use LaTeX & dvipdfmx, or pdfLaTeX. The fonts
longdesc themselves are not included in the package. Six font families
longdesc are supported: kai, song, lishu, fangsong, youyuan and hei. Two
longdesc encodings (GBK and UTF-8) are supported.
